  "about_item": [
    "【PET GROOMING BRUSH SET】The 7 in 1 Pet Hair Removal Tool for pet grooming includes a pet deshedding brush, a self-cleaning slicker brush, a flea comb, a pet grooming comb, a double-sided carpet brush, a plastic pet hair removal tool, and a bath washing brush. With these tools, you can remove excess hair not only from your pet's body but also from carpets, clothes, and beds.",
    "【COMPREHENSIVE SOLUTION FOR PET HAIR REMOVAL】 1 The pet de-shedding brush and the self-cleaning slicker brush can remove loose fur, dirt, and tangles from your pet's coat. 2 The dog grooming comb and the flea comb can remove loose hair, fleas as well as debris from your pet's coat. 3 The double-sided metal rake and plastic hair remover aims at removing excess pet hair from clothes,sofa, bed etc. 4 The pet bath brush is made from high-quality TRP rubber material that is used for bath purpose.",
    "【HOW TO USE IT】Start with the pet-deshedding brush to loosen any excess fur. Next, use a grooming comb to smooth out the pet's fur, then use a flea comb to remove any fleas or eggs . After that, use a slicker brush to untangle any knots or mats in the fur and use the grooming comb to smooth out the hair again. After doing this, the bath washing brush can be used to spead shampoo for bath purpose. The two dog hair removal tools can be used after vacuuming.",
    "【HIGH QUALITY MATERIAL】These tools contains high quality material that are made of rubber, stainless steel, copper blade, etc. They are easy to use and durable for long time use.",
    "【LIGHTWEIGHT & PORTABLE】The weight of the bag (including all tools) is measured around 21 ounces, making it convenient to store in home or carrying out."
  ],
